&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Possible projects to include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying potential customer segment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The Ginkgo Bioworks Early Talent program is open to students who will return to their degree programs upon completion of their employment at Ginkgo. Candidates must be enrolled in a United States based institution and/or have work authorization in the United States to be eligible to participate.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
