&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(78, 75, 72);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW122231794 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW122231794 BCX8&quot;&gt;A four-year degree or higher from an accredited college or university AND a minimum of two (2) to three (3) years of professional experience. Four (4)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW122231794 BCX8&quot;&gt;additional&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW122231794 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;years of professional experience may be used in place of a degree. A graduate degree may substitute for one year of professional experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW122231794 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
