mbaexchange-bayada:greenhouse:8562292002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;There is no place like home and home care is the future of healthcare.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you tired of running from patient to patient? Sick of working for a company that treats you like a number, not like a nurse? Are you ready to provide rewarding 1:1 care, achieve the work-life balance you deserve, and explore a career in home care?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now that you are ready to make a career move, you need to find a home care company that aligns with your high expectations and core values and &lt;strong&gt;BAYADA is the answer! We are not your typical home care company; we are the gold standard in home care. &lt;/strong&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care has been providing exceptional services for over 50 years and is nationally recognized for the respect and appreciation we show our field employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our local office is currently hiring LPNs and RNs to work 1:1 with pediatric and adult clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;We are hiring for full-time, part-time, and per diem opportunities in Williamsport.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Offers Our Nurses:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible scheduling (no p/t-prn scheduling required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Save on gas money, cases close to home (no long commutes, no driving from client to client)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional, paid trainings and orientation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Control - you decide when, where and how you work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Local home office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rewarding 1:1 patient care&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supportive management team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ENHANCED INCENTIVES for nights, weekends and high-tech cases&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;M-F, day shift opportunities available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunities for growth (ask about our SEAL Team)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sign-on BONUS and additional fast track to hire BONUS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preventive Care Coverage for ALL employees (PRN included)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PTO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nurse referral bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Respect, appreciation and support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt;If you’re looking for an employer who truly believes in work life balance and catering to its employees&#39; work preferences, look no further.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt; Our local team has a 90% employee retention and a 94% client retention rate!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we prepare our Nurses for success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid training from day 1 in the office, in the home, and online&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practice with award-winning adult and pediatric Simulation labs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Around the clock clinical support by phone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electronic charting using AlayaCare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We care for clients of all ages, diagnoses, and acuity levels. We offer a multitude of paid training to our nurses to feel comfortable and competent on their first shift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Field Nurse Benefits Include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, Dental, and Vision benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public Service Loan Forgiveness Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401K&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Available Nursing Shifts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Morning, evening or overnight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8’s, 10’s, or 12’s (full shift work)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PRN, Part-Time, or Full-Time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No weekend or minimum requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to join our talent network!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current valid nursing license in the U.S.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduation from a qualified nursing program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
